smells.MagicNumberTest:
Extract the numeric literals (1, 2, -1, 2) into named constants. Example:
```java
private static final JsonPrimitive ONE = new JsonPrimitive(1);
private static final JsonPrimitive TWO = new JsonPrimitive(2);
private static final int NEGATIVE_INDEX = -1;
private static final int OUT_OF_BOUNDS_INDEX = 2;
```
Then replace occurrences:
- `new JsonPrimitive(1)` → `ONE`
- `new JsonPrimitive(2)` → `TWO`
- `list.set(-1, ...)` → `list.set(NEGATIVE_INDEX, ...)`
- `list.set(2, ...)` → `list.set(OUT_OF_BOUNDS_INDEX, ...)`

